{"id":"6cbce44a943995a0","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-lob-theorem.md","title":"Löb's Theorem","display":"df-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-lob-theorem","aliases":["89-df-lob-theorem"],"display":"df-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem","depends_on":["[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","[[89-df-provable-formula]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-numeral]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-lob-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-lob-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lob-theorem — Löb's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d088b00b91690ba0\" href=\"?note=d088b00b91690ba0\" title=\"89-df-numeral\">89-df-numeral</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> is a recursively axiomatized arithmetical theory\nextending PA, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)\\)</span> is the arithmetical provability formula from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"841985de31202f85\" href=\"?note=841985de31202f85\" title=\"89-df-provability-predicate\">89-df-provability-predicate</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\\)</span> is the set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>-provable sentences from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2d52ad4f119b4a14\" href=\"?note=2d52ad4f119b4a14\" title=\"89-df-provable-formula\">89-df-provable-formula</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}\">\\(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}\\)</span> is the object-language numeral naming\nthe Gödel number of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lob}_T(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Lob}_T(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是下述定义的 Löb 性质谓词，句子参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 及其可证性公式为固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是对 Löb 定理结论的命名；它不是把可证明性谓词误作\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> 的函数。</li>\n<li>在标准 Hilbert--Bernays--Löb 推导条件下，所有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-provable-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d088b00b91690ba0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"841985de31202f85","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is the arithmetical provability formula from\n[[89-df-provability-predicate]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-provable-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)$ is the set of $T$-provable sentences from\n[[89-df-provable-formula]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lob}_T(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lob\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\left(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\varphi\\bigr)\n\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ProvFml}(T)\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)","display":false}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lob}_{T}(\\varphi)$ is the property from [[89-df-lob-theorem]]."},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-32","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-theorem]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-342","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-lob-theorem]]"}],"outgoing":["841985de31202f85","2d52ad4f119b4a14","7f53d84c2164d9c5","d088b00b91690ba0"]}